{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00064","headline":"剑客 · 齐己","name":"剑客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拔剑绕残樽，歌终便出门。西风满天雪，何处报人恩。 勇死寻常事，轻雠不足论。翻嫌易水上，细碎动离魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"任国绪"}